# OpenClaw doc-drift-agent: daily scoped README/docs drift review (ADR-001 §7).
# Cron is UTC; runs at 01:00 UTC daily. The orchestrator selects one scope
# (changed ∪ stale, budget 1), runs the worker, and records per-scope state.
# Supersedes doc-drift-cron.sh (the all-READMEs-in-one-pass wrapper).
#
# Deployed to: /etc/cron.d/openclaw-doc-drift (root:root, mode 644).
0 1 * * * openclaw /home/openclaw/.openclaw/scripts/doc-drift-orchestrator.sh
